16. IMPORTANT: INSTALLABLE AASRA WEB APPLICATION (PWA)
==================================================

THIS IS A MAJOR REQUIREMENT.

I do not want the website to be only a website.

I want visitors to be able to install AASRA Web Devs as an application directly from the website.

The website must function as a Progressive Web App (PWA).

When someone visits the website through a compatible mobile browser, they should see a premium installation popup encouraging them to install the AASRA application.

After installation, the AASRA icon should appear on the mobile phone's home screen.

When the user taps that icon, the AASRA website should open in an app-like standalone experience.

The app must use the same website, branding, pages, content, and functionality.

Do not build a separate unrelated application.

